    "note": "US model years 1997, 1998, 2000 and 2001; not sold as a 1999 model. Acura's model chronology: 1997 \"Integra Type-R introduced with 195-hp 4-cylinder, sport suspension, larger brakes, lightweight body\"; 1999 \"RS model dropped; Type-R model suspended; leather upholstery standard on GS-R\"; 2000 \"Type-R returns to lineup with standard air conditioning ...\"; 2001 \"Floor mats standard on all models; final model year\". Acura's 2001 Type R specification sheet (acura-itr-2001-specs) confirms the 2001 model, and Acura's Integra timeline (acura-integra-timeline) says \"Integra Type R returns for the 2000 model year\"."
  },
